  "worked_solution": "We first convert the decimal to a fraction. By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n-7.8=-\\frac{78}{10}=-\\frac{39}{5}.\n$$\n\nNow, we flip the numerator and denominator, keeping the negative sign. So the reciprocal of $-7.8$ is $-\\frac{5}{39}.$",
